      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILLIBY CLASSIC (5) is a two-year-old colt by Classic Connection on debut for the Lee stable. Trotters from this yard are always well educated and he has been trialling nicely. Big chance to kick off with a win. WHERDASUNDONTSHINE (2) missed by just a head at this circuit and distance two back and kept the ball rolling last time when he came from the back row and finished 4.7 metres from the winner in second at Maryborough. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run and a win looks imminent. DANCE WITH ROXY (7) has placed in a trial since breaking at the latest appearance and recorded back-to-back seconds at Kilmore last month. SYNTAX ERROR (1) has been about the mark of late and must be respected from the inside draw.",
